.DS_Store

# D1 reality-gap synthetic ULog fixtures -- regenerated, not committed.
# Rebuild with: python3 tests/fixtures/reality_gap/make_fixtures.py
# Verified byte-deterministic: sha256 of all six generated fixtures is
# identical across repeated runs (the generator's only randomness is a
# fixed-seed numpy default_rng), so regenerating gives exactly the file
# the tests were written against.
# NOTE: this covers .ulg only, matching the instruction. The .bin
# DataFlash fixtures in the same directory are produced by the same
# generator and are equally regenerable, but remain tracked -- so a
# fresh clone has the .bin fixtures and not the .ulg ones. If the intent
# is "no generated fixtures in git", the .bin files should be ignored
# too; left as-is rather than silently widening the rule.
tests/fixtures/reality_gap/*.ulg
